# Wave W17-S (Route 128 Trench): breath floor — warm-niched trench sand: a warm golden-brown swim sand carrying ember-warm flecks standing sparse in the tread — the niches where the cavern\u2019s warmth rises through the floor, drawn in the sand\u2019s own art (design: the water inside the cavern mouth is warmer, and it moves like something breathing in its sleep; the floor keeps the warmth\u2019s register, art layer only). Route 128 Trench\u2019s own floor — the warm breathing dark\u2019s floor: ember-flecked and dusky where Route 127 Trench\u2019s kelp floor is bright golden and cleanly lit, and warmer by far than Route 126 Trench\u2019s volcanic grey.
